OL,3,GNEWSAWindsor's Christmas lights
OL,4,Areplaced to save money
OL,5,
OL,6,FWindsor's famous crown and orb
OL,7,FChristmas lights have been removed this
OL,8,Fyear due to their high maintenance
OL,9,Fcosts.
OL,11,FPeascod Street's familiar decorations
OL,12,Fwere replaced with seven sets of narrow
OL,13,Fflat banners made of white lights.
OL,15,FLiberal Democrat councillors from Royal
OL,16,FBorough of Windsor and Maidenhead
OL,17,Fposted on Facebook that the new lights
OL,18,Fhad been hired "at a similar cost to
OL,19,Fthe previous budget for the maintenance
OL,20,Fof the old lights".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
