OL,3,GNEWSAWindsor's Christmas lights
OL,4,Areplaced to save money
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor for Eton and Castle Mark
OL,7,FWilson said the lights were about 12
OL,8,Fyears old and only five of the seven
OL,9,Fset of lights worked last year.
